BO_ 402253753 DCDC_UDS_Request: 8 Vector__XXX
# CAN ID 0x17FC00B9 - Request to DC-DC

BO_ 402253817 DCDC_UDS_Response: 8 Vector__XXX
# CAN ID 0x17FE00B9 - Response from DC-DC

