 SG_ Terminal_50 : 1|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Vector__XXX
 SG_ Terminal_S : 2|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Vector__XXX
 SG_ Terminal_X : 3|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Vector__XXX
 SG_ BCM_Remotestart_Betrieb : 4|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Vector__XXX

BO_ 1420 Klemmen_Steuerung_01: 8 Vector__XXX
